# Redcap Melee deals 4 damage to Bot2's Llanowar Elves, a green (nonred) permanent: it dies and, because a nonred permanent
# was dealt damage this way, Bot1 sacrifices a land of their choice - the Island, not the Mountain that paid for the spell.
# The sacrifice is only for the controller of the spell (CR 701.21a); Bot2 loses no land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mountain
Redcap Melee
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Redcap Melee.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Island)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Graveyard = Redcap Melee; Island
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain
